aeological Survey of India; hosted by the Internet Archive. Item: Manu-Smrti with the Manubhasya of Medhatithi vol.5 · Jha, Ganganatha · 1926, 714 scanned pages. Published 1926; Ganganatha Jha died 1941; the text is ancient; public domain in India.</p><p>The scans of this book are not stored in this library: its pages are shown from the Internet Archive when they are opened, in this library's own viewer, and each chapter ends with this credit. The text of each page was read from the scan by machine (OCR) for this library, and lightly cleaned; it may contain errors, and the scan of every page is one button away. The item on the Internet Archive (opened only if you click it).</p>"},{"location":"rare-books/manu-smriti-jha-5/pages-1-25.html","title":"Pages 1–25","text":""},{"location":"rare-books/manu-smriti-jha-5/pages-101-125.html","title":"Pages 101–125","text":""},{"location":"rare-books/manu-smriti-jha-5/pages-126-150.html","title":"Pages 126–150","text":""},{"location":"rare-books/manu-smriti-jha-5/pages-151-175.html","title":"Pages 151–175","text":""},{"location":"rare-books/manu-smriti-jha-5/pages-176-200.html","title":"Pages 176–200","text":""},{"location":"rare-books/manu-smriti-jha-5/pages-201-225.html","title":"Pages 201–225","text":""},{"location":"rare-books/manu-smriti-jha-5/pages-226-250.html","title":"Pages 226–250","text":""},{"location":"rare-books/manu-smriti-jha-5/pages-251-275.html","title":"Pages 251–275","text":""},{"location":"rare-books/manu-smriti-jha-5/pages-26-50.html","title":"Pages 26–50","text":""},{"location":"rare-books/manu-smriti-jha-5/pages-276-300.html","title":"Pages 276–300","text":""},{"location":"rare-books/manu-smriti-jha-5/pages-301-325.html","title":"Pages 301–325","text":""},{"location":"rare-books/manu-smriti-jha-5/pages-326-350.html","title":"Pages 326–350","text":""},{"location":"rare-books/manu-smriti-jha-5/pages-351-375.html","title":"Pages 351–375","text":""},{"location":"rare-books/manu-smriti-jha-5/pages-376-400.html